  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_01",
      "hash64": "9C0F8B4400C15227",
      "text": "唔，是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]啊。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_02",
      "hash64": "9C0F8C4400C153DA",
      "text": "……吾辈有件事\\n想恳请你帮忙。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "1B8CBA547CEA44BE",
      "text": "有事找我帮忙？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "1B8CB9547CEA430B",
      "text": "什么事呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_03",
      "hash64": "9C0F8D4400C1558D",
      "text": "其实，这件事\\n不好大声讲出来……[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_04",
      "hash64": "9C0F864400C149A8",
      "text": "据说在帕底亚地区的某处，\\n有种巨～甜无比的……调味料！[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_05",
      "hash64": "9C0F874400C14B5B",
      "text": "吾辈无论如何都想\\n体验一下那甜美的滋味。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_06",
      "hash64": "9C0F884400C14D0E",
      "text": "除了你，没人知道\\n吾辈是个狂热的甜食爱好者，\\r\\n所以能拜托的只有你了……[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_07",
      "hash64": "9C0F894400C14EC1",
      "text": "吾辈要是站出来亲自行动的话，\\n恐怕形象会破坏殆尽……[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_08",
      "hash64": "9C0F824400C142DC",
      "text": "谢礼自然不用说。\\n如果你有兴趣，就考虑一下吧。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_09",
      "hash64": "9C0F834400C1448F",
      "text": "吾辈会事先调查好\\n巨～甜无比的调味料的相关信息。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_10",
      "hash64": "9C12904400C3907D",
      "text": "等吾辈掌握详细情况后，\\n就跟你分享的。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_home_c_11",
      "hash64": "9C128F4400C38ECA",
      "text": "感受到了\\n萨瓦罗老师的信赖！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
